    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659360/extras/348f68af57a36af6014cb5d88b1abab9.poster.avif?t=1752700059\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659360/extras/348f68af57a36af6014cb5d88b1abab9.webm?t=1752700059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Townseek</i> is a relaxing exploration-trading adventure where you take to the skies of <i>Explora</i> in search for the lost legacy of <i>Sir Reginald Sharkingston</i>. Discover exotic landmarks, meet whimsical townsfolk, go fishing, collect rare artefacts, and uncover the secrets of a vibrant world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659360/extras/7505b3a7b07e70af2a6b8525c76953ac.poster.avif?t=1752700059\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659360/extras/7505b3a7b07e70af2a6b8525c76953ac.webm?t=1752700059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659360/extras/7505b3a7b07e70af2a6b8525c76953ac.mp4?t=1752700059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DISCOVER A PICTURESQUE WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a beautifully hand-drawn world brimming with wonder! Journey through lush forests, frozen icebergs, sweeping deserts, fiery volcanoes, and deep oceans. Every region is rich with vibrant detail, filled with striking landmarks, hidden secrets, and colourful curiosities waiting to be found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659360/extras/bb25d34c1298ebb6209edc9c88ef8643.poster.avif?t=1752700059\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659360/extras/bb25d34c1298ebb6209edc9c88ef8643.webm?t=1752700059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659360/extras/bb25d34c1298ebb6209edc9c88ef8643.mp4?t=1752700059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">TRADE WITH UNIQUE TOWNS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Visit charming towns and meet their colourful inhabitants, from sharkfolk and slimes to stonelings and beyond! Trade goods for profit, take on quests to build your reputation, and unlock upgrades and cosmetic rewards. Each town has its own culture, curiosities, and characters to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659360/extras/2cc437a2b4b6a529381f83ed9033057d.poster.avif?t=1752700059\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659360/extras/2cc437a2b4b6a529381f83ed9033057d.webm?t=1752700059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659360/extras/2cc437a2b4b6a529381f83ed9033057d.mp4?t=1752700059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MAKE IT YOUR JOURNEY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Explora</i> is full of things to see and do at your own pace! Customise your airship, cast a line for curious catches, mine for rare artefacts, dig up hidden treasure, grow exotic fruit, snap memorable photos, and befriend adorable companions. Whether you're exploring or unwinding, this journey is yours to shape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659360/extras/2129f0910c6db419bce32fa0ead404b1.poster.avif?t=1752700059\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659360/extras/2129f0910c6db419bce32fa0ead404b1.webm?t=1752700059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659360/extras/2129f0910c6db419bce32fa0ead404b1.mp4?t=1752700059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">COMPLETE YOUR JOURNAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reassemble the journal entrusted to you by <i>Capt. Jawline</i> and follow in the footsteps of <i>Sir Reginald Sharkingston</i>! Along the way, fill its pages with your own discoveries, complete your item collection, and record the memories of an unforgettable voyage that is entirely your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659360/extras/5ea942721b9f9e218fd0fefc49c59fe9.poster.avif?t=1752700059\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659360/extras/5ea942721b9f9e218fd0fefc49c59fe9.webm?t=1752700059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659360/extras/5ea942721b9f9e218fd0fefc49c59fe9.mp4?t=1752700059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659360/extras/348f68af57a36af6014cb5d88b1abab9.poster.avif?t=1752700059\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659360/extras/348f68af57a36af6014cb5d88b1abab9.webm?t=1752700059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Townseek</i> is a relaxing exploration-trading adventure where you take to the skies of <i>Explora</i> in search for the lost legacy of <i>Sir Reginald Sharkingston</i>. Discover exotic landmarks, meet whimsical townsfolk, go fishing, collect rare artefacts, and uncover the secrets of a vibrant world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659360/extras/7505b3a7b07e70af2a6b8525c76953ac.poster.avif?t=1752700059\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659360/extras/7505b3a7b07e70af2a6b8525c76953ac.webm?t=1752700059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659360/extras/7505b3a7b07e70af2a6b8525c76953ac.mp4?t=1752700059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DISCOVER A PICTURESQUE WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a beautifully hand-drawn world brimming with wonder! Journey through lush forests, frozen icebergs, sweeping deserts, fiery volcanoes, and deep oceans. Every region is rich with vibrant detail, filled with striking landmarks, hidden secrets, and colourful curiosities waiting to be found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659360/extras/bb25d34c1298ebb6209edc9c88ef8643.poster.avif?t=1752700059\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659360/extras/bb25d34c1298ebb6209edc9c88ef8643.webm?t=1752700059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659360/extras/bb25d34c1298ebb6209edc9c88ef8643.mp4?t=1752700059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">TRADE WITH UNIQUE TOWNS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Visit charming towns and meet their colourful inhabitants, from sharkfolk and slimes to stonelings and beyond! Trade goods for profit, take on quests to build your reputation, and unlock upgrades and cosmetic rewards. Each town has its own culture, curiosities, and characters to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659360/extras/2cc437a2b4b6a529381f83ed9033057d.poster.avif?t=1752700059\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659360/extras/2cc437a2b4b6a529381f83ed9033057d.webm?t=1752700059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659360/extras/2cc437a2b4b6a529381f83ed9033057d.mp4?t=1752700059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MAKE IT YOUR JOURNEY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Explora</i> is full of things to see and do at your own pace! Customise your airship, cast a line for curious catches, mine for rare artefacts, dig up hidden treasure, grow exotic fruit, snap memorable photos, and befriend adorable companions. Whether you're exploring or unwinding, this journey is yours to shape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659360/extras/2129f0910c6db419bce32fa0ead404b1.poster.avif?t=1752700059\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659360/extras/2129f0910c6db419bce32fa0ead404b1.webm?t=1752700059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659360/extras/2129f0910c6db419bce32fa0ead404b1.mp4?t=1752700059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">COMPLETE YOUR JOURNAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reassemble the journal entrusted to you by <i>Capt. Jawline</i> and follow in the footsteps of <i>Sir Reginald Sharkingston</i>! Along the way, fill its pages with your own discoveries, complete your item collection, and record the memories of an unforgettable voyage that is entirely your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659360/extras/5ea942721b9f9e218fd0fefc49c59fe9.poster.avif?t=1752700059\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659360/extras/5ea942721b9f9e218fd0fefc49c59fe9.webm?t=1752700059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659360/extras/5ea942721b9f9e218fd0fefc49c59fe9.mp4?t=1752700059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "short_description": "Take to the skies on a whimsical voyage across Explora and uncover the lost legacy of Sir Reginald Sharkingston! Trade, fish, mine, and farm, meeting whimsical characters and exploring vibrant towns along the way. The whole world is your sea now, so set sail and see all it has to offer!",
